From 12b0e249e706099d79310cc95a2695e9924c706b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:53:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Plant journal: title/content split, multi-photo entries,
 system-entry toggle

Split journal entries into a required title plus an optional notes/content
field, replaced the single-photo upload with a proper multi-photo table
(PlantLogPhotoModel) supporting add/remove per entry, and added an is_system
flag with a client-side toggle so automatically generated log entries can be
hidden from user-authored journal entries. Includes a 5.11 -> 5.12 upgrade
path that backfills title/is_system from existing content and migrates
existing single photos into the new photo table.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RX3nSGz3wkwjEseGuUdKtR
